<title>UK: SOCCER-BARRY TOWN WIN LEAGUE OF WALES CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BARRY TOWN WIN LEAGUE OF WALES CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF, LONDON 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of</p>
<p>the Welsh Cup on Saturday:</p>
<p> Bangor City   2   Barry Town    2</p>
<p>(after extra time, 90 mins: 1-1. Barry Town won 4-2 on</p>
<p>penalties)</p>
</text>
